flowchart LR
    Client[Client]
    Gateway[API Gateway :8080\nJWT filter\nGateway routes]
    Auth[Auth Service :8083\nJWT generation]
    User[User Service :8091\nJPA/H2\nRedis cache]
    Order[Order Service :8092\nOpenFeign]
    Eureka[Eureka Server :8761]
    Config[Config Server :8888]
    ConfigRepo[(config-repo)]
    Redis[(Redis :6379)]
    H2[(H2 in-memory database)]

    Client --> Gateway
    Gateway -->|/auth/**| Auth
    Gateway -->|/users/**| User
    Gateway -->|/orders/**| Order
    Gateway -->|/secure/**| Auth
    Order -->|GET /users/getAll| User
    User --> H2
    Gateway -. configured rate limiting .-> Redis
    User -. configured cache .-> Redis
    Auth -. registers .-> Eureka
    User -. registers .-> Eureka
    Order -. registers .-> Eureka
    Gateway -. registers .-> Eureka
    Config --> ConfigRepo
    Gateway -. config import .-> Config
    Auth -. config import .-> Config
    User -. config import .-> Config
    Order -. config import .-> Config
